    <drawables>
        <!-- The entity icons of resources/drawables once more, without
             automaticPalette="false". That attribute keeps them in native
             colour format, which only Dc.drawBitmap2()'s tint needs - an API
             Connect IQ 3 devices do not have. On a 16-bit colour display it
             makes every icon 7.3 kB instead of 0.6 kB, loaded for every
             redraw of the card view. Wired up in monkey.jungle for the one
             device where that hurts: the Venu Sq, 16-bit colour in 64 KB.
             An icon that is added to resources/drawables but not here just
             keeps its larger form there. -->
